{"id":763,"doub_id":763,"title":"上帝也疯狂 The Gods Must Be Crazy","years":"1980","class":"喜剧","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2173719538.webp","doub_score":8.7,"IMDB_number":"tt0080801","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"加美·尤伊斯","bianji":"[\"加美·尤伊斯\",\"加美·尤伊斯\",\"马瑞斯·威尔斯\",\"Sandra Prinsloo\",\"历苏\",\"Louw Verwey\",\"Michael Thys\"]","performer":"马瑞斯·威尔斯、Sandra Prinsloo、历苏、Louw Verwey、Michael Thys","language":"英语、南非荷兰语、Ungwatsi","release":"1980-09-10(南非)、1981-08-21(挪威)","alias":"众神也疯狂 (上)、上帝一定发疯了 (上)、绝境求生","abstract":"广袤无垠的非洲大陆，现代文明与原始社会和谐共存。在离现代大都市六千公里的卡拉哈里沙漠腹地，生活着仍未受到外来文明影响的布须曼人。他们刀耕火种，狩猎农作，过着与世无争、敬畏自然的平静生活。某天，一支来自现代文明的可乐瓶打乱了他们一成不变的日子。最先发现瓶子的基（N!xau 饰）将其带回部落，族人惊叹可乐瓶子的完美构造和繁多的用途，认为这是上帝赐予他们的礼物。可是兴奋的心情很快为别样的情绪所取代，习惯了平等共有的族人开始想要将瓶子据为己有，矛盾悄然而生。基不愿看到族人发生争吵与殴斗，于是决定将可乐瓶还给上帝，只为恢复曾经平静快乐的生活…… ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1912299980.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1912303454.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1912302227.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1912300184.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459456100.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2173719647.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2173719538.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/14EzRdq50_qArP_rfUAtQ-g?pwd=1it5\",\"size\":\"1\",\"date\":\"2025-06-20\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"104分钟","address":" 南非 / 博茨瓦纳","orginName":"上帝也疯狂 The Gods Must Be Crazy","ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 喜剧片\n","tag":""}